& [PlanStatus] is formed_activation_blocked

& [I03A] is dependency and no-resolution activation
  + depends on current formation and separately reviewed activation source
  + pins exact jsonschema family checksums with default-features false
  + proves compile-time and runtime resolver absence exact meta-schema API numeric boundary and Windows debug release execution
  + locks exact Cargo and source touch plus rollback
  + stops before production parser or validator integration

& [I03B] is faithful byte ingress
  + depends on I03A activation but can remain validator-independent in code structure
  + implements bounded exact UTF-8 one-value parsing duplicate-name observation structural accounting exact numeric-token spans and atomic faults
  + exposes no generic authoritative Value until all ingress gates pass
  + proves malformed trailing duplicate depth name numeric and exhaustion adversaries

& [I03C] is residual registry
  + depends on I03B stable source-location and byte-observation forms
  + compiles RMS-R01 through RMS-R06 and I03-R007 through I03-R020 exact records
  + builds root type enforcement function and proof reverse indexes plus registry digest
  + validates every I02 schema residual reference resolves exactly once
  + performs no validator or semantic execution

& [I03D] is independent schema and serde observation
  + depends on I03A I03B and I03C
  + integrates explicit Draft 2020-12 meta compile and instance observations after local-reference preflight
  + decodes the three actual input Rust types from original bytes and serializes the two actual output intended-use fixtures
  + emits stable bounded observations without treating library display messages as identity
  + proves numeric recursion error and no-resolution behavior

& [I03E] is corpus report and exact replay
  + depends on I03D
  + admits immutable cases coverage relations and optional safe semantic evaluator bindings
  + produces normalized deterministic findings coverage residual and resource accounts
  + repeats the full pure run and requires byte-identical report output
  + closes all 32 I03 requirements only after locked offline debug release lint docs audit evidence and diff gates pass

& [DependencyChain] is I03A then I03B then I03C then I03D then I03E
  + I03B design may proceed before dependency admission but implementation authority does not
  + I03C record drafting may proceed statically but compiled registry authority does not
  + no later slice can substitute its tests for an earlier slice proof

& [CheckpointPolicy] requires one review commit per completed slice
  + each checkpoint has source preservation canonical activation lock requirement status solution review proof and narrative closure
  + generated corpus or reports enter only after their generator checkpoint is committed and their generation revision is exact
  + a blocked host admission preserves the candidate without a completion claim and work moves only to independent static preparation

& [ForbiddenExpansion] is compatibility classification provider model service runtime persistence network external effect production release hardware FPGA and general-purpose untrusted execution

& [NextAuthorizedAction] is static I03A activation-source preparation only after the present readiness package is reviewed
